19582      /* STAT-SURVEYFREQ-014: SURVEYFREQ — Discordant Proportion Difference / Kappa Coefficients
19583       * Source: S154 / Chapter 118 / `Discordant Proportion Difference` (PDF pp. 9657–9658); S154 / Chapter 118 / `Kappa Coefficients` (PDF pp.
19583    ! 9658–9661).
